<title>USA: Alamogordo, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Alamogordo, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $5.700 million of Alamogordo, N.M., general obligation sanitary sewer refunding and water improvement bonds, Series Dec., 1, 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.83 percent.</p>
